--- !u!114 &226623946
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 226623945}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a11ab1ef00000000000000000000a001, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Readable
  title: Page
  fullText: '[No title. Pages are water-damaged and partially burned.]



    ---



    ...found
    it again.



    The thing in the wall isn''t the specimen.



    The specimen
    was Patient 0.

    There were others.



    Twelve of us came in on the first
    rotation.

    I counted the beds this morning.



    There are fourteen.



    ---



    They
    don''t sleep.

    I''ve started leaving the light on.



    It doesn''t help.

    They
    don''t need darkness.



    They just need you to be alone.



    ---



    Note
    to self:

    Stop writing in this.

    If they find it they''ll know you know.



    If
    you''re reading this it means they found me first.



    It means you''re already
    alone.



    ---



    [Last page. Written in something that isn''t ink.]



    You
    felt it when you walked in here.



    That feeling that something was watching.



    That
    wasn''t paranoia.



    It''s still in the room with you.



    It has been
    since you opened the door.



    Don''t turn around.



    Whatever you do.



    Don''t.



    Turn.



    Around.'
  charsPerPage: 600
