--- !u!114 &777026585
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 777026584}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a11ab1ef00000000000000000000a001, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Readable
  title: Page
  fullText: "Personal Log \u2014 Dr. Elena Voss\r\n\r\nIf you found this room, you
    were meant to.\r\nI built it myself. Three months ago. Before they started watching
    more closely. The specimen didn't escape containment. I helped it. I know how
    that sounds. But you haven't spent 14 months with it\r\nlike I have.\r\n\r\nIt's
    not dangerous.\r\nIt never was.\r\n\r\nWe were the dangerous ones. The photos
    on this desk are mine. My daughter turns 7 next month. I don't think I'll make
    it home for that. They know I know too much. The \"transfer\" requests have started.
    I've seen what happens after those.\r\n\r\nIf you're reading this, I'm already
    gone.But you're still here. And that means you still have a chance. The chest
    in this room belonged to the lead researcher. He kept the emergency exit key
    inside. The combination is the date all of this began.\r\n\r\nThe date on the
    specimen's first file. The date stamped on the wall when you came in. You already
    know it.\r\n\r\nGet out.\r\nDon't look back.\r\nDon't tell them you found this
    room.\r\n\r\n\u2014 E.V."
  charsPerPage: 600
