--- !u!114 &1591154400
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1591154399}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a11ab1ef00000000000000000000a001, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Readable
  title: Research Journal
  fullText: "Research Log - Entry 12\r\n\r\nThe specimen has been tapping the wall.\r\nSame
    wall. Same spot.\r\nEvery night at 3AM.\r\nWe thought it was random at first.\r\nDr.
    Reeves said it was a stress response.\r\nDr. Elena Voss said it was communication.\r\nWe
    dismissed her. \n\nDay 3 of the tapping.\r\nI started counting.\r\nThree taps.
    Pause. Three taps. Pause.\r\nAlways three.\r\n\r\nDay 5.\r\nVoss pulled me aside
    in the corridor.\r\nShe whispered something I didn't catch.\r\nI asked her to
    repeat it.\r\nShe looked at the camera above us and walked away.\r\n\r\nDay 7.\r\nVoss
    is gone.\r\nThey said she requested a transfer.\r\nHer coffee mug is still on
    her desk.\r\nShe loved that mug.\r\nPeople don't leave their favorite mug behind.\r\n\r\nDay
    9.\r\nI walked the corridor again tonight.\r\nThe east section near junction
    B.\r\nThe wall sounds different there.\r\nHollow. Wrong.\r\nThe texture is slightly
    darker than the rest.\r\nLike something was patched over in a hurry.\r\nI pressed
    my ear against it.\r\nI could hear something on the other side.\r\n\r\nBreathing.\r\n\r\nOr
    maybe I'm losing my mind.\r\nThat happens here too.\r\n\r\nDay 10.\r\nI'm writing
    this in case I disappear like Voss.\r\nIf you're reading this \u2014\r\nyou already
    know something is wrong.\r\nTrust the wall.\r\nTrust what sounds hollow.\r\nDon't
    trust the people who built this place.\r\n\r\n\u2014 Entry incomplete"
  charsPerPage: 300
